A '''rail''' is a non-solid [[block]] that provides a path along which [[minecart]]s can travel, and can be placed either flat on the ground, as a ramp, or curved.

A '''curved rail''' allows minecarts to turn corners, and can rotate to connect to a different rail line while [[powered]].

== Obtaining ==
=== Breaking ===
The suitable tool to break a rail is a [[pickaxe]]. It will always drop itself when broken.
{{breaking row|horizontal=1|Rail|pickaxe}}
=== Natural generation ===
Rails can be found naturally running along the floor in [[mineshaft]]s, both in the center of tunnels and under loot [[chest minecart]]s, and in the "pumpkin ring room" of [[woodland mansion]]s.

=== Generated loot ===
{{LootChestItem|rail}}

=== Crafting ===
{{Crafting
|A1= Iron Ingot
|C1= Iron Ingot
|A2= Iron Ingot
