'''Red sandstone''' is a variant of [[sandstone]]. It comes in three other variants: [[cut red sandstone]], [[chiseled red sandstone]], and [[smooth red sandstone]].

== Obtaining ==
=== Breaking ===
The suitable tool to break red sandstone is [[pickaxe]]. Red sandstone needs to be broken using a pickaxe, otherwise the breaking time will increase and the block drops nothing.
{{breaking row|horizontal=1|Red Sandstone|Pickaxe|Wood|link=none}}
Red sandstone drops itself when it's destroyed.

=== Natural generation ===
{{Exclusive|java|section=1}}
Red sandstone replaces [[Red Sand|red sand]] in [[badlands]] when generated floating, most commonly in [[noise cave]] entrances and rarely in floating platforms below [[structures]] that overlap with badlands.

